# SDKMAN toolchain — installed by `dot sdkman install` (and by ./setup.sh).
#
# Format:  <candidate> [spec] [default]
#   <candidate>        no spec → SDKMAN's current default (latest stable), self-updating
#   java latest        newest Temurin build — auto-advances (26 now, 27 when it ships)
#   java <major>       latest Temurin patch of that major (e.g. 25 → 25.0.3-tem)
#   default            mark this java as the GLOBAL default JDK
#
# The global default is the latest; pin a specific JDK per project with an
# .sdkmanrc file (auto-switches on cd — see configure_sdkman_auto_env). Newer
# versions arrive via `dot update` (sdk upgrade), like Brewfile: bundle installs.

gradle
maven
